# Lives in Netlify → Site configuration → Environment variables. Never
# bundled into the browser. Copy to .env for `netlify dev`.

# The password for /admin. Unset means the admin page is closed to everyone —
# it holds names and phone numbers, so a missing variable must lock it, not
# open it.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=

# Her Zelle name and handle are NOT set here — they are not secret, and they
# need to show up on the order page, so they are plain constants in
# shared/config.ts (ZELLE_NAME, ZELLE_HANDLE). Fill those in before this goes
# live.
